      "writtenOn": "2022-08-24T01:55:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`_high` causes us to assert `PROCHOT`, and `_halt` triggers thermal shutdown. Since these are the release values, this means that we won\u0027t release thermal shutdown until we would also release `PROCHOT` (so the system would come back online at full speed). This seems fine, and I see other boards do the same thing.",
      "parentUuid": "295a0e31_e1b9407b",
